            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu azotikiza imbere yanyu amahanga mugiye gutera no kunyaga igihugu. Ariko nimwamara kubirukana mukaba mu gihugu cabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bamaze kurandurwa imbere yanyu muze mwiyubare ntimuzogwe mu mutego wo kurondera kumenya ivyerekeye imana zabo, mukavuga muti: “Mbega aya mahanga yasenga imana zabo gute? Dushaka gusenga nka bo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuzosenge ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu nk’uko basenga imana zabo, kuko mu gusenga kwabo bakora ibizira vy’ubwoko bwose ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yanka. Mbere baratanga abahungu n’abakobwa babo kugira ngo baturirwe kw’ibimazi vy’ishikanwa bashikaniye imana zabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
